==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Though the stage may appear threatening—with the Ritual Drum Doge freezing your units while Festival Otter push—Ritual Drum Doge does not freeze for any significant period of time to be considered threatening. The low magnification of the Otters means that any meatshield can completely stall them.

